aur monster that  appeared in the terror of make a  godzilla movie titanosaurus is an  aquatic animal and can breathe and swim  at speeds of up to 200 kilometers per  hour underwater  the monster is physically capable of  matching godzilla's power it is a deep  sea creature with fins on board of its  tail  and back and two tiny ones on both sides  of its head  there are also two antennas on the top  of its head  he features a bipedal physique with a  long neck a snout that looks like a  raptor  and short muscular arms his scales are  red in color with an orange underbelly  and neck and this dinosaur kaiju was 60  meters or 200 feet tall 100 meters or  328 feet long and weighed 30 000 tons  number four rodin  yeah this one isn't actually a dinosaur  kaiju but a pterosaur so close yet so  far away a close cousin to dinosaurs  okay which we will include in this list  rodan made his first appearance  alongside godzilla in the 1964 godzilla  film ghidorah the three-headed monster  ronin resembles a large pterosaur that  walks upright on two legs rodan  generally has either brown or burgundy  skin with spiky chests and two horns on  the back of its head his biggest version  is the fire demon titan of the  monsterverse in this stake he was 47  meters or 154 feet tall has a wingspan  of 871 feet or 265.5 meters and weighs  in at more than 39 000 tons  number three anguirus  this one is a famous rival turned best  friend of godzilla like godzilla  anguirus managed to survive into the  modern day by lying dormant somewhere  presumably underwater before being  awakened and irradiated by nuclear bombs  in the 1950s anguirus walks mostly on  all foes but can be bipedal as well the  most recognizable features of this  dinosaur kaiju is its armored back lined  with rows of spikes like a porcupine it  is a descendant of the ankilosaurus it  has been seen in the showa era up to the  millennium era of films in final wars it  was 40 meters or 131 feet tall on all  foes but 90 meters o